  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "\u0110\u1EA5u s\u0129"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Ephemeral], [Lifesteal]\r\n-
    Ta s\u1EBD ch\u1EBFt sau khi t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng ho\u1EB7c k\u1EBFt th\xFAc l\u01B0\u1EE3t.\r\n-
    h\u1ED3i cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i l\u01B0\u1EE3ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    g\xE2y ra."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 ma lai \u2014 ban ng\xE0y mang h\xECnh ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, ban
    \u0111\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE0 n\u1ED9i t\u1EA1ng t\xE1ch kh\u1ECFi th\xE2n
    r\u1ED3i bay \u0111i ki\u1EBFm \u0111\u1ED3 \xF4 u\u1EBF ho\u1EB7c h\xFAt sinh
    kh\xED. Ta ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 nh\u1EADp x\xE1c tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi tr\u1EDDi
    s\xE1ng."
